          "#text": "This subclass includes:\n- packing cases and boxes with solid sides, lids and bottoms, crates, fruit or vegetable boxes, egg trays and other containers with slatted sides and open tops, boxes made of sliced or peeled wood, match boxes and conical open containers for marketing butter, fruit, etc.\n- large drums, used to hold and transport electric cables, telephone cables and similar cables.",
